{"speciesId":629,"names":{"fr":"Vostourno","es":"Vullaby","en":"Vullaby","ja":"バルチャイ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses ailes sont trop petites pour lui permettre de voler. Quand l’évolution approche, il sort lui-même de sa coquille."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its wings are too tiny to allow it to fly. As the time approaches for it to evolve, it discards the bones it was wearing."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il trouve des os convenables pour protéger ses arrières, puis harcèle les Pokémon plus faibles que lui."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They tend to guard their posteriors with suitable bones they have found. They pursue weak Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Their wings are too tiny to allow them to fly. They guard their posteriors with bones that were gathered by Mandibuzz."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Their wings are too tiny to allow them to fly. They guard their posteriors with bones that were gathered by Mandibuzz."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses ailes sont trop petites pour lui permettre de voler. Quand l’évolution approche, il sort lui-même du crâne qui le protège."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"No puede volar porque sus alas son muy pequeñas. Cuando va a evolucionar, se deshace de su calavera."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its wings are too tiny to allow it to fly. As the time approaches for it to evolve, it discards the bones it was wearing."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"翼が 小さいため 飛べない。 進化の ときが 近づくと 自分から ガイコツを 脱ぎ捨てる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses ailes sont trop petites pour voler. Il protège son croupion avec un crâne apporté par un Vaututrice."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus pequeñas alas no le permiten volar. Usa una calavera que le dio Mandibuzz para proteger sus posaderas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Their wings are too tiny to allow them to fly. They guard their posteriors with bones that were gathered by Mandibuzz."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"翼は 小さく まだ 飛べない。 バルジーナが 集めてきた ガイコツで お尻を 守っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ses ailes sont trop petites pour lui permettre de voler. Quand l’évolution approche, il sort lui-même du crâne qui le protège."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"No puede volar porque sus alas son muy pequeñas. Cuando va a evolucionar, se deshace de su calavera."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Its wings are too tiny to allow it to fly. As the time approaches for it to evolve, it discards the bones it was wearing."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"翼が 小さいため 飛べない。 進化の ときが 近づくと 自分から ガイコツを 脱ぎ捨てる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ses ailes sont trop petites pour voler. Il protège son croupion avec un crâne apporté par un Vaututrice."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sus pequeñas alas no le permiten volar. Usa una calavera que le dio Mandibuzz para proteger sus posaderas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Their wings are too tiny to allow them to fly. They guard their posteriors with bones that were gathered by Mandibuzz."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"翼は 小さく まだ 飛べない。 バルジーナが 集めてきた ガイコツで お尻を 守っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il protège son tendre popotin avec le crâne d’une de ses proies. Il en change régulièrement en grandissant."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Protege sus posaderas blanduzcas con los huesos de las presas que ha devorado. A medida que crece se ve obligado a cambiarlos."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It protects its plump posterior with the bones of prey it has consumed. As it grows, it replaces the bones."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"ぷよぷよの お尻を 守るのは 喰った 獲物の 骨。 成長のたび はき替えるよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il est encore très joueur. Ses ailes n’étant pas assez développées pour lui permettre de voler, il se déplace en sautillant."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Todavía está en su más tierna infancia. Como sus alas aún no se han desarrollado del todo, se desplaza dando saltos."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It can’t fly yet and must wait until its wings have developed more. Since it’s still at a playful age, it hops around friskily."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"まだまだ 遊び盛り。 羽が 未熟で 飛べないので ぴょんぴょん 跳ね回っているよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Sa culotte est un cadeau de Vaututrice. Ses petites ailes ne pouvant pas le porter, il est condamné à sautiller en rêvant au grand azur."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"El cráneo que usa de protección es regalo de un Mandibuzz. Como sus alas son muy cortas para volar, da brincos soñando que vuela por el cielo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Mandibuzz gives it the bones it wears. Vullaby’s wings are short, so it can’t fly yet, but it jumps around, dreaming of wide open skies."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ガイコツは バルジーナが 与える。 翼は 短く まだ 飛べないが 大空を 夢見て 飛び跳ねる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ce petit est en pleine croissance et forcit à vue d’œil. Il doit donc régulièrement changer le crâne qui lui sert de culotte."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Demuestra un voraz apetito y aumenta de tamaño a vista de ojo. Su continuo crecimiento le obliga a cambiar varias veces de cráneo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its healthy appetite leads to visible growth spurts. It often has to replace the bones it wears as its size increases."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"食べ盛りの 育ち盛り。 身体の 成長に あわせて ガイコツを 何度も 履き替えるよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ils protègent leur derrière en portant un crâne comme couche. Ils se disputent les plus douillets d’entre eux."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Usa una calavera para proteger sus posaderas. A menudo pelea con sus congéneres para hacerse con la más cómoda."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It wears a bone to protect its rear. It often squabbles with others of its kind over particularly comfy bones."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"骸骨を はき お尻を ガード。 はき心地の いい 骸骨を めぐり 仲間同士で 小競り合う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il grandit vite. Au sein du nid, les petits Vostourno héritent des couches en crâne de leurs aînés."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Deja en el nido las calaveras que va descartando a medida que crece con celeridad para que las reutilicen futuras generaciones."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Vullaby grow quickly. Bones that have gotten too small for older Vullaby to wear often get passed down to younger ones in the nest."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"すぐに 大きく 育つので お尻の 骸骨は 巣の 中で お下がりとして 使いまわされる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":629,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"gust","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"whirlwind","learns":[[11,"level-up",55],[14,"level-up",55],[15,"level-up",55],[16,"level-up",55],[17,"level-up",55],[18,"level-up",55],[20,"level-up",36],[25,"level-up",36]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fury-attack","learns":[[11,"level-up",5],[14,"level-up",5],[15,"level-up",5],[16,"level-up",5],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"toxic","learns"